@startuml
title 360 Performance Appraisal & OKR Calibration Workflow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #0f172a
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #f8fafc
skinparam ActivityFontColor #0f172a
skinparam ActivityFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityFontStyle bold

skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #1d4ed8
skinparam SwimlaneWidth 220
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontColor #1e3a8a
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontSize 14
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontStyle bold

skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5

|HR Manager|
start
:Initialize Annual 360 Performance Review Cycle;

|Department Manager|
:Cascade Department Objectives & Align Individual OKRs;

|Employee|
:Log Monthly Key Result Progress Updates;
:Complete Self-Appraisal Form & Peer Feedback;

|Department Manager|
:Review Peer & Self Feedback;
:Conduct 1-on-1 Performance Coaching Meeting;
:Submit Manager Evaluation & Rating Scorecard;

|HR Manager|
:Conduct Company Performance Calibration Meeting;
if (Rating Curve Balanced?) then (Approved)
  :Finalize Ratings & Merit Salary Increases;
else (Outlier)
  :Adjust Score Rating with Justification;
endif

|Employee|
:Receive Final Appraisal Scorecard & Update IDP Plan;
stop
@enduml
